WEBVTT

00:00:11.414 --> 00:00:16.587
Reweight: a judge picks the steps that train.

00:00:16.587 --> 00:00:20.725
Reweight: reasoning tokens count half.

00:00:20.725 --> 00:00:24.863
Rewrite: fix a step's reasoning.

00:00:24.863 --> 00:00:27.966
Rewrite: the new text stays context only.

00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:32.104
Reroll: try again from step 3.

00:00:32.104 --> 00:00:37.276
Reroll: four tries from the first error, compared with each other.

00:00:37.276 --> 00:00:43.483
Combine all three in one function.

00:00:43.483 --> 00:00:47.883
github.com/TokenWave-AI/PRL
